msgctxt "Comment"
msgid "Generates the convolution of one vector with another."
msgstr "एक सदिस के दूसरे के साथ कन्वल्सन बनाथे."

#: src/plugins/convolution/deconvolve/kstobject_deconvolve.desktop:8
msgctxt "Name"
